> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select * from (values (0, 9998), (1, 1000)) v(id, x),
>   lateral (select f1 from a26_i where f1 = any (select unique1 from a26_t where unique2 = v.x offset 0)) ss
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop
  Output: "*VALUES*".column1, "*VALUES*".column2, a26_i.f1
  ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*"
        Output: "*VALUES*".column1, "*VALUES*".column2
  ->  Nested Loop Semi Join
        Output: a26_i.f1
        Join Filter: (a26_i.f1 = a26_t.unique1)
        ->  Seq Scan on public.a26_i
              Output: a26_i.f1
        ->  Materialize
              Output: a26_t.unique1
              ->  Index Scan using a26_t_u2 on public.a26_t
                    Output: a26_t.unique1
                    Index Cond: (a26_t.unique2 = "*VALUES*".column2)
-- EXPLAIN

